umentation/BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModTowerSaveData.md\">ModTowerSaveData</a>  ModTowerSaveData</p>\n<h3 id=\"properties\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#properties\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Properties</h3>\n<p><a name=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModTowerSaveData.TowerBaseId\"></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"modtowersavedatatowerbaseid\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#modtowersavedatatowerbaseid\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>ModTowerSaveData.TowerBaseId</h2>\n<p>The associated base tower id of this ModTowerSaveData.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-cs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">override</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> TowerBaseId { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">get</span>; }\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"property-value\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#property-value\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Property Value</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/System.String\" title=\"System.String\">System.String</a></p>","tableOfContentsHtml":"<nav class=\"toc\"><ol class=\"toc-level toc-level-1\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h4\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h4\" href=\"#bloonstd6-mod-helper\">BloonsTD6 Mod Helper</a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h3\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h3\" href=\"#btd_mod_helperapitowers\">BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers</a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h2\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h2\" href=\"#modtowersavedata-class\">ModTowerSaveData Class</a><ol class=\"toc-level toc-level-2\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h4\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h4\" href=\"#type-parameters\">Type parameters</a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h3\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h3\" href=\"#properties\">Properties</a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-item-h2\"><a class=\"toc-link toc-link-h2\" href=\"#modtowe